      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not uncommon for people with hyperthyroidism to experience an increased heart rate and jitteriness when taking stimulants like Adderall. The interaction between hyperthyroidism and Adderall can be complex, but it's generally recommended to work closely with your doctor to taper off the Adderall dose and find an alternative medication for your ADHD, as the combination may not be ideal for your condition. Your doctor may also consider adjusting your thyroid medication dose to manage symptoms and prevent interactions.",
