      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the \"talk to your doctor\" thing but i have a huge presentation tomorrow and i really need the focus. i dont want to go through a whole tapering process right now because it'll mess up my work. i've been thinking about maybe just taking a slightly higher dose of the adderall so i can actually get through the day, or maybe just taking it with a lot of water? do you think that would help with the racing heart feeling or is that just the hyperthyroidism acting up?",
